ewline no effect:  vval{prr-pr1-noeffect}
ewline every higher iteration count and capacity lowers $ho$, by at most  vval{prr-more-dmax}}
ewline IBU at five iterations: $ho<0$ at both truths, moving past the truth (Table~ef{tab:prr-rho}) \ \addlinespace 5.

